---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { writings } from "../data/writings";
---
<BaseLayout title="思考笔记本">
<section class="inner-heading">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">THE OPEN NOTEBOOK</span>
<h1>顺着好奇，<br>多翻<span class="ink-word">一页。</span>
</h1>
<p>关于记忆、上下文与 Agent 的研究笔记。一个问题，留几条继续思考的线索。</p>
</div>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/read.png" alt="Kenny 的阅读插画" width="1254" height="1254">
</section>
<section class="collection section" aria-label="笔记集合">
<div class="notes-controls">
<div>
<label class="field-label" for="note-search">在笔记中搜索</label>
<input id="note-search" type="search" placeholder="标题、摘要，或一个关键词">
</div>
<button class="primary" id="random-note" type="button">随机翻一篇 ↗</button>
</div>
<div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="按主题筛选笔记">
<button data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">所有笔记</button>
<button data-filter="memory" aria-pressed="false">记忆与遗忘</button>
<button data-filter="context" aria-pressed="false">上下文</button>
<button data-filter="agents" aria-pressed="false">Agent 工程</button>
</div>
<p id="collection-count" class="small-status" role="status">
</p>
<div class="notebook-list">{writings.articles.map(note=>
<details class="note-record" id={`note-${note.id}`} data-entry data-category={note.topic}>
<summary>
<span class="note-date">{note.date}<br />{note.source}</span>
<span class="note-title">{note.title}</span>
<span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</summary>
<div class="note-body">
<p>{note.teaser}</p>
<div class="detail-links">
<a href={note.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">去知乎读全文 ↗</a>
<a href={note.topic === 'memory' ? '/projects/#tracework' : '/projects/'}>看看相关工具 →</a>
</div>
</div>
</details>)}</div>
<div class="no-results" id="collection-empty" hidden>
<h3>这一页暂时是空白。</h3>
<p>换个词，或清除筛选再翻翻。</p>
<button class="text-button" id="clear-filters" type="button">清除搜索与筛选 ↺</button>
</div>
<p class="editor-note">这里展示已有文章的摘要与线索，全文在原发布平台阅读。</p>
</section>
<aside class="next-room">
<span>想法怎样落到实践</span>
<a href="/projects/">回工具架看看 →</a>
</aside>
</BaseLayout>
